    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>7级 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 96；''重伤'' 48</span><span>''先攻'' +6</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 20，''强韧'' 22，''反射'' 20，''意志'' 17</span><span>''侦查'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6（冲锋时为 8）</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">以血还血（医疗）</div>\n<div class=description>当该半兽人伤疤领主命中一个重伤的目标时；该攻击造成 1d6 额外伤害，且该半兽人伤疤领<br>主恢复 5 点生命值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}巨斧（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+10 vs. AC<br>命中：1d12+8（重击时则为 1d12+20）伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}负伤反击✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>触发：当首次重伤时。<br>该半兽人伤疤领主进行一次巨斧攻击。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">狂怒进攻✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>触发：当该半兽人伤疤领主伤害一个敌人时。<br>该半兽人伤疤领主的攻击造成 1d10 额外伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 运动+13，坚韧+11，威吓+7</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 21（+8）</span><span>''敏捷'' 17（+6）</span><span>''感知'' 11（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 16（+6）</span><span>''智力'' 10（+3）</span><span>''魅力'' 8（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，巨人语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 巨斧</span></div></div>\n</div>",
